  "description": "The text 'ban them' refers to a call for legal or social prohibition of the niqab, which is a real-world policy proposal that has been debated in some Western countries. This call is rooted in the belief that religious attire should not be permitted in public spaces, often under the guise of 'freedom' or 'safety'.",
